# debug

Boolean that defaults to 0 and will remain 0 in Runtime no matter what the setting is.

With 1 a developer gets additional features an additional menu "Developers" in the menubar:

* Toggle the "magic grid" on the form
* Edit any user defined callbacks during run time
* Browse the `Input` class (read-only)

  This can be useful in order to read the documentation or look at implementation details.

